# "Sacrifice an artifact or creature": with no creature, Bot1 pays by sacrificing a noncreature artifact (Mox Jet), chosen from
# the artifacts only - the Swamp (a land, neither) is not offered (`! Bot1.Choose(Swamp)`), and the Mox Pearl it keeps is not
# sacrificed. The Swamp pays {B}. Bot2's Llanowar Elves is destroyed.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Stir Up Trouble
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Forest x12

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Stir Up Trouble.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves)
Bot1.Modes(Sacrifice an artifact or creature)
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
! Bot1.Choose(Swamp)
Bot1.Choose(Pay mana)
Bot1.Choose(Mox Jet)
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Swamp; Mox Pearl
Bot1.Graveyard = Stir Up Trouble; Mox Jet
Bot2.Battlefield = Forest
Bot2.Graveyard = Llanowar Elves
